# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Centralized Alerting:** Provides a unified approach to monitor and notify about service failures."
msgstr "**Centralizuotas priminimas:** Suteikia vieningą požiūrį stebėti ir pranešti apie paslaugų trūkumus."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Centralized Configuration:** Promotes `.profile` as the single source for shared shell settings."
msgstr "**Centralizuota konfigūracija:** Rekotai `.profile` kaip vienas šaltinis bendro apvalkalo nustatymams."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Centralized Configuration:** Promotes ``.profile`` as the single source for shared shell settings."
