msgid "**Composable**: designed to be called repeatedly for many domains."
msgstr "**Kompozityvus**: sukurta, kad būtų nuolat vadinamas daugelyje sričių."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Compose and Swarm:** The role deploys in both modes and renders the gateway configuration file for the local host and the swarm peers."
