# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Eligibility is read from LiteLLM's own catalog; a declaration is the override.** The image ships `model_prices_and_context_window_backup.json`, 1595 models deep, carrying `max_input_tokens`, `supports_vision`, `supports_function_calling` and `input_cost_per_token`. The hook reads a route's capabilities from `litellm.model_cost`, keyed on the route's own `litellm_params.model` and then on that name without its first segment, because `ollama/llama3` is filed prefixed while `openai/gpt-4o-mini` is filed as `gpt-4o-mini`. It never probes a backend at request time."
msgstr "**Tinkamumas vertinamas iš paties LiteLLM katalogo; deklaracija yra override.** Vaizdiniai laivai `model_prices_and_context_window_backup.json`, 1595 modeliai giliai, vežantis `max_input_tokens`, `supports_vision`, `supports_function_calling` ir `input_cost_per_token`. Kablys skaito maršruto galimybes iš `litellm.model_cost`, klaviatūra ant paties maršruto `litellm_params.model` ir tada šį pavadinimą be savo pirmąjį segmentą, nes `ollama/llama3` yra pateiktas iš anksto nustatytas, o `openai/gpt-4o-mini` yra pateiktas kaip `gpt-4o-mini`. Ji niekada zondo atgal prašymu laiku."

# translated-by: libretranslate
