# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Pass**: `make compose-playwright role=<role>` exits `0` AND every MUST in [Contributing `playwright.spec.js`](../../../contributing/artefact/files/role/playwright.specs.js.md) holds for the resulting run."
msgstr "**Praeiti**: `make compose-playwright role=<role>` išėjimai `0` IR kiekvienas PRIVALO [Indėlis `playwright.spec.js`](../../../contributing/artefact/files/role/playwright.specs.js.md) laiko gautam važiavimui."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Paths that look wrong and are not.** Policies mount at `/openbao/policies/`, because OpenBao parses *every* file under `-config` as server configuration. Storage is `/openbao/file`, not `/openbao/data`: the image pre-chowns only `/openbao/{config,logs,file}` for the non-root `openbao` user, so a volume elsewhere lands root-owned and raft cannot write. `command:` is just `server` — the entrypoint appends `-config` itself, and passing it duplicates the flag."
msgstr "**Keliai, kurie atrodo blogai ir nėra.** Politika `/openbao/policies/`, nes OpenBao pertraukos *kas* failas po `-config` kaip serverio konfigūracija. Laikymas `/openbao/file`, ne `/openbao/data`: paveikslėlis tik prieš chows `/openbao/{config,logs,file}` nešaknų `openbao` vartotojas, todėl apimtis kitur žemių Roothold ir plaustas negali rašyti. `command:` yra tik `server` - entrypoint priedėliai `-config` pats, ir pro jį dubliuoja vėliava."

