# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**SSO authentication:** Access is protected by Keycloak via oauth2-proxy."
msgstr "**SSO autentifikavimas:** Prieiga yra saugoma Keycloak per oauth2- Proxy."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**SSO flavor is `oauth2`** (oauth2-proxy sidecar → Keycloak), NOT native OIDC — because Checkmk Raw has no OIDC. The oauth2-proxy authenticates against Keycloak and passes `X-Remote-User`; Checkmk's site Apache trusts it via `auth_by_http_header`. This mirrors [`web-app-openproject`](../../roles/web-app-openproject/)'s header-SSO bridge (`OPENPROJECT_AUTH__SOURCE__SSO_HEADER` + LDAP-gated header trust)."
msgstr "**SSO skonis yra `oauth2`** (oauth2- proxy sidecar → Keycloak), NE gimtoji OIDC - nes Checkmk Žalia neturi OIDC. Autas2- proxis atpažįsta Keycloak ir praėjimai `X-Remote-User`; Checkmk 's site Apache pasitiki jį per `auth_by_http_header`. Tai veidrodžiai. [`web-app-openproject`](../../roles/web-app-openproject/)Header- SSO tiltas (`OPENPROJECT_AUTH__SOURCE__SSO_HEADER` LDAP- paguldytas antraštinis pasitikėjimas)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**SSO round-trip test:** ``test-oidc-login.js`` drives ``/sso/key/generate`` through the Keycloak login form and asserts the UI no longer falls back to its own password gate."
msgstr "**SSO žiedinės kelionės bandymas:** ``test-oidc-login.js`` diskai ``/sso/key/generate`` per Keycloak prisijungimo forma ir tvirtina UI nebegrįžta prie savo slaptažodžio vartų."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**SSO round-trip test:** `test-oidc-login.js` drives `/sso/key/generate` through the Keycloak login form and asserts the UI no longer falls back to its own password gate."
msgstr "**SSO žiedinės kelionės bandymas:** `test-oidc-login.js` diskai `/sso/key/generate` per Keycloak prisijungimo forma ir tvirtina UI nebegrįžta prie savo slaptažodžio vartų."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**SSO via Keycloak:** configured automatically on first deploy."
msgstr "**SSO via Keycloak:** sukonfigūruoti automatiškai pirmą kartą dislokuoti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**SSO via oauth2-proxy with auto-provisioning:** V1 gates all access through the shared Keycloak OIDC client (oauth2-proxy edge). openresty forwards the authenticated identity to n8n as a trusted `Remote-Email` header (`templates/proxy.conf.j2`); an `EXTERNAL_HOOK_FILES` script (`files/hooks.js`, adapted from [PavelSozonov/n8n-community-sso](https://github.com/PavelSozonov/n8n-community-sso)) reads that header, auto-provisions a local n8n user on first sign-in, and issues n8n's own session cookie — so every Keycloak user lands directly in the workflow editor, with no second, n8n-local login step."
msgstr "**SSO via oauth2-proxy with auto-application:** V1 vartai visą prieigą per bendrą Keycloak OIDC klientas (oauth2- proxy kraštas). pradėti teikti autentiškumą tapatybės n8n kaip patikimas `Remote-Email` antraštė (`templates/proxy.conf.j2`); `EXTERNAL_HOOK_FILES` scenarijus (`files/hooks.js`, pritaikytas [PavelSozonov / n8n-community-sso](https://github.com/PavelSozonov/n8n-community-sso)) skaito, kad antraštės, automatiškai teikia vietos n8n vartotojas pirmą ženklą- į, ir klausimai n8n savo sesijos slapukas - todėl kiekvienas Keycloak vartotojas žemės tiesiai į darbo srauto redaktorius, be sekundės, n8n vietos prisijungimo žingsnis."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**SSO via oauth2-proxy with auto-provisioning:** V1 gates all access through the shared Keycloak OIDC client (oauth2-proxy edge). openresty forwards the authenticated identity to n8n as a trusted ``Remote-Email`` header (``templates/proxy.conf.j2``); an ``EXTERNAL_HOOK_FILES`` script (``files/hooks.js``, adapted from `PavelSozonov/n8n-community-sso <https://github.com/PavelSozonov/n8n-community-sso>`__) reads that header, auto-provisions a local n8n user on first sign-in, and issues n8n’s own session cookie — so every Keycloak user lands directly in the workflow editor, with no second, n8n-local login step."
msgstr "**SSO via oauth2-proxy with auto-application:** V1 vartai visą prieigą per bendrą Keycloak OIDC klientas (oauth2- proxy kraštas). pradėti teikti autentiškumą tapatybės n8n kaip patikimas ``Remote-Email`` antraštė (``templates/proxy.conf.j2``); ``EXTERNAL_HOOK_FILES`` scenarijus (``files/hooks.js``, pritaikytas `PavelSozonov/n8n-community-sso <https://github.com/PavelSozonov/n8n-community-sso>`__) skaito, kad antraštės, automatiškai teikia vietos n8n vartotojas pirmą ženklą- į, ir klausimai n8n savo sesijos slapukas - todėl kiekvienas Keycloak vartotojas žemės tiesiai į darbo srauto redaktorius, be sekundės, n8n vietos prisijungimo žingsnis."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**SSO** is SuiteCRM's own SAML login against Keycloak (`sso.flavor: saml` in [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml)), not a proxy in front of it. Unauthenticated requests hit the Symfony firewall's SAML entry point, which redirects to Keycloak; the assertion comes back to `/saml/acs` and establishes a real SuiteCRM session, so the app renders its own authenticated UI including its logout control. Accounts are created on first login from the assertion (`SAML_AUTO_CREATE`), and the IdP signing certificate is read from Keycloak's realm descriptor by [`files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh`](./files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh) at boot, over the Tor SOCKS proxy whenever the issuer is an onion, because a `.onion` issuer is unresolvable directly. `/auth` stays reachable as the local break-glass login."
msgstr "**SSO** yra SuiteCRMsavo SAML prisijungimas prie Keycloak (`sso.flavor: saml` yra [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml))- Prieš jį ne įgaliotinis. Nepatvirtinti prašymai nukentėjo Symfony ugniasienės SAML įvažiavimo taškas, kuris nukreipia į Keycloak; teiginys grįžta į `/saml/acs` ir nustato tikrą SuiteCRM seansas, todėl programa pateikia savo autentiškumą UI, įskaitant savo registracijos kontrolės. Paskyros sukuriamos pirmą kartą prisijungus prie pareiškimo (`SAML_AUTO_CREATE`), ir IVP pasirašymo sertifikatas yra skaitoma iš Keycloaksferos deskriptorius pagal [`files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh`](./files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh) įkrovos, per Tor SOCKS proxy, kai emitentas yra svogūnas, nes `.onion` emitentas tiesiogiai negali būti pertvarkytas. `/auth` lieka pasiekiami kaip vietos Break- stiklo prisijungimo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**SSO** is SuiteCRM’s own SAML login against Keycloak (``sso.flavor: saml`` in ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__), not a proxy in front of it. Unauthenticated requests hit the Symfony firewall’s SAML entry point, which redirects to Keycloak; the assertion comes back to ``/saml/acs`` and establishes a real SuiteCRM session, so the app renders its own authenticated UI including its logout control. Accounts are created on first login from the assertion (``SAML_AUTO_CREATE``), and the IdP signing certificate is read from Keycloak’s realm descriptor by ```files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh`` <./files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh>`__ at boot, over the Tor SOCKS proxy whenever the issuer is an onion, because a ``.onion`` issuer is unresolvable directly. ``/auth`` stays reachable as the local break-glass login."
msgstr "**SSO** yra SuiteCRMsavo SAML prisijungimas prie Keycloak (``sso.flavor: saml`` yra ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__), not a proxy in front of it. Unauthenticated requests hit the Symfony firewall’s SAML entry point, which redirects to Keycloak; the assertion comes back to ``/saml/acs`` and establishes a real SuiteCRM session, so the app renders its own authenticated UI including its logout control. Accounts are created on first login from the assertion (``SAML_AUTO_CREATE``), and the IdP signing certificate is read from Keycloak’s realm descriptor by ```files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh`` <./files/shell/docker-entrypoint.sh>`__ at boot, over the Tor SOCKS proxy whenever the issuer is an onion, because a ``.onion`` issuer is unresolvable directly. ``/auth`` lieka pasiekiami kaip vietos Break- stiklo prisijungimo."

