msgstr "Antropinis klavišas"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "An Arch Linux based system; ``package_install`` sets up the unprivileged AUR build environment itself."
msgstr "Arch Linux grindžiama sistema; ``package_install`` pati sukuria neprivilegijuotą AUR kūrimo aplinką."

# translated-by: libretranslate
