# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Cross-service probes (biber denied at prometheus, biber denied at matomo, dashboard tile reachability) are NOT part of the per-role biber persona. They live in the provider's own spec (`web-app-{prometheus,matomo,dashboard}/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`), parameterised once over the provider's `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest. For the dashboard, the parameterised scenario delegates to `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/dashboard-card-flow.js::runDashboardCardScenario(page, context, target)`, which owns the tile visibility / iframe-embed / \"Tab\" pop-out assertions in one SPOT."
msgstr "Kryžminio aptarnavimo zondai (biber neigia Prometheus, biber neigia matomo, prietaisų skydo plytelių pasiekiamumas) nėra dalis perrole biber persona. Jie gyvena paties teikėjo spec (`web-app-{prometheus,matomo,dashboard}/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`), parametrized kartą per teikėjo `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` Taip. Dėl prietaisų skydelio, parametrizuotas scenarijus deleguoja `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/dashboard-card-flow.js::runDashboardCardScenario(page, context, target)`, kuris turi plytelių matomumą / iframe- empled / \"Tab\" pop-out tvirtinimai vienoje SPOT."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Cross-service probes are NOT part of the per-role administrator persona. Dashboard tile reachability is owned by `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`, which delegates the per-target body to the `runDashboardCardScenario` helper in `dashboard-card-flow.js` (tile visible → click loads in `#main iframe` → header \"Tab\" button pops the embed into a fresh browser tab). That helper is the SPOT for dashboard-tile mechanics; consumer specs MUST NOT reimplement any of those assertions. Prometheus admin-reach and scrape parity are owned by `web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Matomo admin-reach and tracker presence are owned by `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Each provider parameterises the assertion over its `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest."
msgstr "Kryžminio aptarnavimo zondai NĖRA dalis perrole administratorius persona. Dashboard plytelių pasiekiamumas priklauso `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`, kuris deleguoja į taikinį kūno `runDashboardCardScenario` pagalbininkas `dashboard-card-flow.js` (plytelių matomas → spustelėkite apkrovas `#main iframe` → antraštė \"Tab\" mygtuką pops įrėmintas į naują naršyklės skirtuką). Kad pagalbininkas yra prietaisų-plytelių mechanikos SPOT; vartotojų spec. neturi iš naujo įgyvendinti bet kurį iš šių teiginių. Prometheus admin- access ir grange parity priklauso `web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Matomo administr- pasiekti ir sekimo buvimas priklauso `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Kiekvienas teikėjas parameterizuoja tvirtinimo per savo `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` Taip."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Cross-service surface assertions (dashboard tile reachability, prometheus admin-reach and scrape parity, matomo admin-reach and tracker presence, biber-denied-at-prometheus, biber-denied-at-matomo) are owned by the provider's own spec. Each provider parameterises the assertion over its `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest, rendered via `lookup('roles_with_service', '<svc>')`. Consumer roles' personas MUST NOT duplicate these probes."
msgstr "Kryžminio aptarnavimo paviršiaus pareiškimai (prietaisų skydo plytelių pasiekiamumas, tinkamumas naudoti ir grandyti paritetas, matomo admin- access ir tracker buvimas, biber- neigde- promethus, biber- neigde- matomo) priklauso paties teikėjo spec. Kiekvienas teikėjas paramederuoja savo `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifestas, pagamintas per `lookup('roles_with_service', '<svc>')`. Vartotojų vaidmenų personažai NEPRIVALO dubliuoti šių zondų."

