# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Files produced by the containerized runner (e.g. `__pycache__/*.pyc` under [`tests/`](tests/), build artefacts) are often owned by `nobody` or another in-container UID and cannot be removed from the host. When a host-level `rm`/`chmod`/edit fails with `Permission denied` on such paths, agents MUST run the cleanup via `make compose-exec` (see [compose.yml](compose.yml); the repo is mounted at `/opt/src/infinito`) and MUST NOT ask the operator which path to take."
msgstr "Failai, kuriuos sukūrė konteineris bėgikas (pvz., `__pycache__/*.pyc` pagal [`tests/`](tests/), statyti artefaktus) dažnai priklauso `nobody` arba kitą vidinį konteinerį UID ir negali būti pašalintas iš šeimininko. Kai būrio lygis `rm`/`chmod`/ redaguoti nepavyksta su `Permission denied` ant tokių kelių, agentai PRIVALO paleisti valymo per `make compose-exec` (žr. [compose.yml](compose.yml); atpirkimo sandoris įrengiamas `/opt/src/infinito`) NEPRIVALO prašyti operatoriaus, kuriuo keliu eiti."

