msgstr "Jei pokytis paveikia Antarktinis vaidmuo, turite refaktorius ir optimizuoti **visas vaidmuo**, ne tik failus, kurie buvo tiesiogiai pakeistas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If the change affects the CI flow (stages, gates, order), also update [pipeline.md](../../../artefact/git/pipeline.md)."
msgstr "Jei pokytis turi įtakos CI srautui (etapai, vartai, tvarka), taip pat atnaujinti [pipeline.md](../../../artefact/git/pipeline.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If the change affects user-visible behavior, you MUST add or update the matching end-to-end coverage in [Role `playwright.spec.js`](playwright.spec.js.md)."
msgstr "Jei pokytis paveikia vartotojo matomą elgesį, turite pridėti arba atnaujinti atitikimo pabaigos aprėptį [Vaidmuo `playwright.spec.js`](playwright.spec.js.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
