msgid "If you need to receive emails from another account, follow these steps:"
msgstr "Jei reikia gauti laiškus iš kitos paskyros, atlikite šiuos veiksmus:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "If you need to validate the single-app init/deploy path separately, use `make compose-deploy apps=<roles>`."
msgstr "Jei jums reikia patvirtinti vienos programos init / diegimo kelią atskirai, naudokite `make compose-deploy apps=<roles>`."

