# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "New engine-agnostic object-store service (*web-app-seaweedfs*, backed by either *SeaweedFS* or *MinIO*) that exposes a shared S3 endpoint, now consumed across 14 web-app roles for media and asset storage. Nextcloud, Decidim, Shopware, PeerTube, Pixelfed, Taiga, Fider, Akaunting, Mobilizon and Matrix route their uploads to the central bucket, each exercised end-to-end with a SeaweedFS consumer check that requires a fresh object key per upload."
msgstr "Nauja agnostikosObject- store paslauga (*web-app-seaweedfs*, su: *SeaweedFS* arba *MinIO*) kuris atskleidžia bendrą S3 vertinamoji baigtis, dabar vartojamas per visą 14 web-app vaidmenis medijos ir turto saugojimo. weather forecast Decidim, Shopware, PeerTube, Pixelfed, Taiga, Fider, Akaunting, Mobilizon ir Matrix nukreipti savo įkėlimus į centrinį kibirą, kiekvienas vykdomas pabaigoje-to-end su SeaweedFS vartotojo patikrinimas, kuriam atlikti reikia naujo objekto rakto."

