# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Operator-facing tooling for provisioning inventories, running dedicated deploys, and managing host secrets across an Infinito.Nexus environment."
msgstr "Operator-facting įraning for prodiusing inventors, veikia specialios dislokavimas, ir valdyti priimančiosios paslaptis visoje Infinito.Nexus aplinka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Operator-requested: isolate MDAD's Ansible runtime from Infinito's so MDAD can pin its own `ansible-core` / collection versions without crossing into the Infinito Ansible venv."
msgstr "Operator - prašoma: izoliuoti MDAD anketa Anteniškas bėgimo laikas nuo Infinito 's, kad MDAD gali prisegti savo `ansible-core` / surinkimo versijų be kirtimo į Infinito Antable venv."

