# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Security: resolved all 80 open CodeQL/code-scanning alerts and added recurrence guards. Broke an unsafe import cycle in *cli/administration/deploy/development* via a leaf *env.py*; hardened *web-app-bluesky* *server.js* (cookie prototype-pollution guard, log sanitisation, HTML-escaped exceptions, ReDoS-bounded handle regex) and *web-app-baserow* SSO open-redirect handling; required TLS ≥ 1.2 in network diagnose probes; validated *actionlint* tar members against path traversal; rewrote *decidim*/*apt-purge* regexes to avoid catastrophic backtracking; anchored six Playwright URL regexes and pinned *crs-k/stale-branches* to a SHA. Guards: an *import-linter* contract, a lint requiring justified bandit *noqa*, and ruff *BLE001* as a ratchet."
msgstr "Saugumas: išspręsti visi 80 Atverti CodeQL / code- skenavimo perspėjimus ir pridėtus pasikartojimo apsaugus. Sutrikęs nesaugus importo ciklas in *cli/administration/deploy/development* per lapą *env.py*; sukietintas *web-app-bluesky* *server.js* (slapukų prototipų taršos apsauga, žurnalo sanavimas, HTML- pabėgti išimtys, ReDoS- apriboti rankena regex) ir *web-app-baserow* SSO atlikimas atviru būdu; reikalinga NLS ≥ 1.2 tinklo diagnozavimo zondus; patvirtintas *actilintas* deguto nariai nuo kelio keliautojas; perrašytas *decidimas*/*apt- valymas* regols išvengti katastrofiškas nugaros sekimas; įtvirtinti šešis Playwright URL regols ir connection *crs- k / state- šakos* į SHA. Sargai: an *import- linter* sutartis, lint, reikalaujantis pagrįstas banditas *noqa*, ir nuodegos *BLE001* kaip reketas."

