# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Snipe-IT is entered through a trusted-header bridge: the oauth2-proxy authenticates against Keycloak and Snipe-IT's `loginViaRemoteUser()` mints a native session for the matching `users.username` row (see [`files/php/apply/sso_config.php`](./files/php/apply/sso_config.php)). The gate declares no `allowed_groups`, so `biber` passes the proxy — but the role provisions only the administrator account ([`tasks/03_admin.yml`](./tasks/03_admin.yml)), so the header carries a username Snipe-IT does not know and the visitor falls back to the native login form. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`, while the `administrator` persona stays live (`PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=false`) and exercises the full bridge end to end."
msgstr "Mini-IT įvedamas per patikimą-header tiltas: oauth2- proxis atpažįsta Keycloak ir Snipe- IT `loginViaRemoteUser()` kalina gimtąją sesiją suderinimui `users.username` eilutė (žr. [`files/php/apply/sso_config.php`](./files/php/apply/sso_config.php)). Vartai skelbia ne `allowed_groups`, taigi `biber` eina įgaliojimą - bet vaidmuo nuostatos tik administratoriaus sąskaitą ([`tasks/03_admin.yml`](./tasks/03_admin.yml)), todėl antraštės turi vartotojo vardą Snipe- IT nežino ir lankytojas grįžta į gimtąją prisijungimo formą. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) Todėl pareiškia `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`, o `administrator` asmuo lieka gyventi (`PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=false`) ir pratimai visą tiltą baigiasi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Snipe-IT is entered through a trusted-header bridge: the oauth2-proxy authenticates against Keycloak and Snipe-IT’s ``loginViaRemoteUser()`` mints a native session for the matching ``users.username`` row (see ```files/php/apply/sso_config.php`` <./files/php/apply/sso_config.php>`__). The gate declares no ``allowed_groups``, so ``biber`` passes the proxy — but the role provisions only the administrator account (```tasks/03_admin.yml`` <./tasks/03_admin.yml>`__), so the header carries a username Snipe-IT does not know and the visitor falls back to the native login form. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true``, while the ``administrator`` persona stays live (``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=false``) and exercises the full bridge end to end."
msgstr "Mini-IT įvedamas per patikimą-header tiltas: oauth2- proxis atpažįsta Keycloak ir Snipe- IT ``loginViaRemoteUser()`` kalina gimtąją sesiją suderinimui ``users.username`` eilutė (žr. ```files/php/apply/sso_config.php`` <./files/php/apply/sso_config.php>`__). The gate declares no ``allowed_groups``, so ``biber`` passes the proxy — but the role provisions only the administrator account (```tasks/03_admin.yml`` <./tasks/03_admin.yml>`__), so the header carries a username Snipe-IT does not know and the visitor falls back to the native login form. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true``, while the ``administrator`` persona stays live (``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=false``) ir pratimai visą tiltą baigiasi."

