# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The actual app deploy runs inside a **sealed throwaway Docker daemon** and is torn down on exit, so the host's own stack is never touched. Several runners can share one host (or coexist with other workloads) safely."
msgstr "Tikrasis programėlės diegimas vyksta viduje **hermetiškas Docker tarnyba** ir yra sudraskyti ant išėjimo, todėl šeimininko kamino niekada liesti. Keletas bėgikų gali pasidalinti vienu mazgu (arba egzistuoja kartu su kitais darbo apkrovomis) saugiai."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The adapter `digest` pins nothing. All ten `implementation: adapter` roles carry the identical placeholder `sha256:` followed by sixty-four zeros, the schema only checks that prefix, and the running image is resolved through `lookup('container_image', …)` instead. A lint that rejects the placeholder has to land together with real digests rather than before them."
msgstr "Adapteris `digest` Nieko. Visi dešimt `implementation: adapter` vaidmenys turi identišką kontrolinį `sha256:` po šešių-keturių nulių, schema tik tikrina, kad priešdėlis, ir veikia vaizdas yra išspręstas per `lookup('container_image', …)` vietoj to. Užuomina, kuri atmeta placebo turėtojas turi nusileisti kartu su nekilnojamojo griovimo, o ne prieš juos."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The adapter is what bounds that. [`files/mcp/tools.json`](./files/mcp/tools.json) names the nine read tools of `calendar`, `contacts` and `files` — the three categories whose upstream `is_available` is unconditional, so the set does not vary with which optional apps a deployment installs. `svc-ai-mcp-adapter` refuses any tool outside that list and any tool marked `mutating` while `mutating_tools_enabled` is false, and it refuses to start at all if the contract's `schema_sha256` does not match the file. The refusal happens in the sidecar, so it holds for every client regardless of what each renders locally."
msgstr "Adapteris yra tai, kas ribos. [`files/mcp/tools.json`](./files/mcp/tools.json) pavadinimai devynių skaityti įrankius `calendar`, `contacts` ir `files` - trijų kategorijų, kurių `is_available` yra besąlygiškas, todėl rinkinys nesiskiria nuo kurios pasirenkamos programos diegimo įdiegia. `svc-ai-mcp-adapter` atsisako bet kokio įrankio, esančio ne tame sąraše, ir bet kokio įrankio, pažymėto `mutating` o `mutating_tools_enabled` yra klaidingas, ir jis atsisako pradėti iš viso, jei sutartis `schema_sha256` neatitinka failo. Atsisakymas vyksta nuošalioje pusėje, todėl jis galioja kiekvienam klientui nepriklausomai nuo to, ką kiekvienas pateikia vietoje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The adapter is what bounds that. ```files/mcp/tools.json`` <./files/mcp/tools.json>`__ names the nine read tools of ``calendar``, ``contacts`` and ``files`` — the three categories whose upstream ``is_available`` is unconditional, so the set does not vary with which optional apps a deployment installs. ``svc-ai-mcp-adapter`` refuses any tool outside that list and any tool marked ``mutating`` while ``mutating_tools_enabled`` is false, and it refuses to start at all if the contract’s ``schema_sha256`` does not match the file. The refusal happens in the sidecar, so it holds for every client regardless of what each renders locally."
msgstr "Adapteris yra tai, kas ribos. ```files/mcp/tools.json`` <./files/mcp/tools.json>`__ names the nine read tools of ``calendar``, ``contacts`` and ``files`` — the three categories whose upstream ``is_available`` is unconditional, so the set does not vary with which optional apps a deployment installs. ``svc-ai-mcp-adapter`` refuses any tool outside that list and any tool marked ``mutating`` while ``mutating_tools_enabled`` is false, and it refuses to start at all if the contract’s ``schema_sha256`` neatitinka failo. Atsisakymas vyksta nuošalioje pusėje, todėl jis galioja kiekvienam klientui nepriklausomai nuo to, ką kiekvienas pateikia vietoje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The adapter presents `ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_KEY` to the provider in the header named by `ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_AUTH_HEADER` (default `Authorization`), formatted by `ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_AUTH_FORMAT` (default `Bearer {key}`, where `{key}` is the credential)."
msgstr "Adapteris pristato `ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_KEY` paslaugų teikėjui antraštėje, pavadintoje `ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_AUTH_HEADER` (numatytasis `Authorization`), suformatuotas `ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_AUTH_FORMAT` (numatytasis `Bearer {key}`, kur: `{key}` yra įgudęs)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The adapter presents ``ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_KEY`` to the provider in the header named by ``ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_AUTH_HEADER`` (default ``Authorization``), formatted by ``ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_AUTH_FORMAT`` (default ``Bearer {key}``, where ``{key}`` is the credential)."
msgstr "Adapteris pristato ``ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_KEY`` paslaugų teikėjui antraštėje, pavadintoje ``ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_AUTH_HEADER`` (numatytasis ``Authorization``), suformatuotas ``ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_AUTH_FORMAT`` (numatytasis ``Bearer {key}``, kur: ``{key}`` yra įgudęs)."

