msgstr "Pati kelionė nekrenta. ```files/playwright/test-native-login.js`` <./files/playwright/test-native-login.js>`__ drives both personas through Funkwhale’s own chain: ``/login``, the Keycloak round trip whenever the proxy gates that route, then Funkwhale’s own sign-in form, an authenticated-surface assertion, and sign-out back to the anonymous state. It is skipped when ``services.ldap.enabled`` is false, because no persona holds a Funkwhale account in that variant. The ``guest`` persona ir pagrindiniai pareiškimai vyksta besąlygiškai."

