# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The lint test in ``tests/lint/repository/settings/test_claude_sorted.py`` requires every hand-curated array to stay ASCII-sorted ascending so diffs stay reviewable and merge conflicts stay minimal. Tools that auto-extend the file (e.g. permission auto-allowlists) tend to append unsorted; this script puts everything back in order."
