msgid "This role deploys Test E2E Cli."
msgstr "Šis vaidmuo vykdomas Test E2E Cli."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys XWiki using Docker, automating the installation, configuration, and management of your XWiki server. It integrates with an relational database and a reverse proxy. The role supports advanced features such as global CSS injection, Matomo analytics, OIDC authentication, and centralized logout, making it a powerful and customizable solution within the Infinito.Nexus ecosystem."
msgstr "Šis vaidmuo vykdomas XWiki naudojant Docker, automatizuoti montavimo, konfigūracijos, ir valdymo savo XWiki serveris. Jis integruojamas su reliacinės duomenų bazės ir atvirkštinio proxy. Vaidmuo palaiko pažangias funkcijas, pavyzdžiui, visuotinę CSS injekciją, Matomo analitika, OIDC autentifikavimo, ir centralizuotas išsiregistruoti, todėl jis galingas ir pritaikomas sprendimas per Infinito.Nexus ekosistema."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Zammad as an Infinito.Nexus web app using the upstream ``ghcr.io/zammad/zammad`` image (Rails app, WebSocket, scheduler, nginx, plus a one-shot init container that bypasses the setup wizard via ``auto_wizard.json``). Search is provided by a bundled Elasticsearch container; PostgreSQL, Redis and Memcached are consumed from the central ``svc-db-*`` providers via ``sys-stk-full``. Authentication uses direct OpenID Connect against the shared Keycloak client; LDAP federation and SMTP/IMAP via Mailu are wired when their providers are present."
msgstr "Šis vaidmuo vykdomas Zammad kaip Infinito.Nexus web app, naudojant prieš ``ghcr.io/zammad/zammad`` paveikslėlis (Rails app, WebSocket, Reguliatorius, nginx, plius vieno šūvio viduje konteineris, kuris aplenkia sąrankos vedlys per ``auto_wizard.json``). Ieškoti suteikia paketas Elasticsearch konteineris; PostgreSQL, Redis ir Memcached yra suvartojami iš centrinės ``svc-db-*`` teikėjai per ``sys-stk-full``. Autentiškumo nustatymas naudoja tiesioginį OpenID Prisijungti prie bendro Keycloak klientas; LDAP federacija ir SMTP / IMAP per Mailu yra laidinės, kai jų tiekėjai yra."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Zammad as an Infinito.Nexus web app using the upstream `ghcr.io/zammad/zammad` image (Rails app, WebSocket, scheduler, nginx, plus a one-shot init container that bypasses the setup wizard via `auto_wizard.json`). Search is provided by a bundled Elasticsearch container; PostgreSQL, Redis and Memcached are consumed from the central `svc-db-*` providers via `sys-stk-full`. Authentication uses direct OpenID Connect against the shared Keycloak client; LDAP federation and SMTP/IMAP via Mailu are wired when their providers are present."
