# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys the LiteLLM admin UI as the browser-facing entry point of the headless LiteLLM Gateway. It runs in host mode and starts no container of its own: it claims a canonical domain, terminates TLS, applies the platform Content-Security-Policy, and reverse-proxies that domain to the local HTTP port the gateway publishes. Visitors sign in with the gateway's own UI credentials."
msgstr "Šis vaidmuo dislokuoja LiteLLM admin UI kaip į naršyklę atsuktas įėjimo taškas headless LiteLLM Gateway. Jis veikia priimančiosios režimu ir nepradeda savo konteinerį: jis teigia kanoninis domenas, nutraukia TLS, taiko platformą Content- Security- Policy, ir returse-proxies, kad domeno vietos HTTP uosto vartai skelbia. Lankytojai prisistato naudodami savo UI duomenis."

