msgid "When a new script is added with a bind-mount target, its purpose and in-container target path SHOULD be documented at the call site (the matching `compose/<service>/` README, or [compose.yml.md](../../docs/contributing/artefact/files/compose.yml.md))."
msgstr "Kai naujas scenarijus yra pridedamas su bind- mount tikslą, jo tikslas ir in- konteinerio tikslo kelias SHOULD būti dokumentuojamas skambučių svetainėje (atitikimas `compose/<service>/` README arba [compose.yml.md](../../docs/contributing/artefact/files/compose.yml.md))."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When a plugin is marked `enabled: false`, `06_plugin.yml` runs `occ app:disable` for that plugin instead of entering the pipeline."
msgstr "Kai įskiepis pažymėtas `enabled: false`, `06_plugin.yml` veikia `occ app:disable` tai įskiepiai, o ne patekti į vamzdyną."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When a role in the include set declares `run_after: [<other>]`, `<other>` is added to the include set."
msgstr "Kai vaidmuo įtraukti rinkinys deklaruoja `run_after: [<other>]`, `<other>` pridedamas prie rinkinio."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "When a role in the include set declares `services.<svc>` with literal `enabled: true and shared: true`, the role behind that service is added."
msgstr "Kai vaidmuo įtraukti rinkinys deklaruoja `services.<svc>` su pažodine `enabled: true and shared: true`, už šios paslaugos vaidmuo yra pridedamas."

