# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "WordPress's canonical surface is the public blog front page. The OIDC round-trip fires on `/wp-login.php`, which the `daggerhart-openid-connect-generic` addon auto-redirects to Keycloak (`login_type: auto`, see [`meta/addons/daggerhart-openid-connect-generic.yml`](./meta/addons/daggerhart-openid-connect-generic.yml)); the shared personas enter at the site root and never visit that path. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. The journeys themselves are not dropped: `test-admin-oidc-login.js` drives the admin login, logout and landing assertion, and `test-rbac-roles.js` drives the Keycloak-group-to-WordPress-role mapping over the same entry point."
msgstr "WordPress kanoninis paviršius yra viešas dienoraščio pirmame puslapyje. OIDC žiedinės kelionės gaisrai `/wp-login.php`, `daggerhart-openid-connect-generic` addon auto- nukreipti į Keycloak (`login_type: auto`, žr. [`meta/addons/daggerhart-openid-connect-generic.yml`](./meta/addons/daggerhart-openid-connect-generic.yml)); bendras asmuo patekti į svetainę šaknis ir niekada aplankyti tą kelią. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) Todėl pareiškia `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` ir `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. Pačios kelionės nėra numestos: `test-admin-oidc-login.js` vairuoja administratoriaus prisijungimo, registracijos ir iškrovimo pareiškimą, ir `test-rbac-roles.js` vairuoja Keycloak-grupė-ikiWordPress-vaidmuo kartografavimo per tą patį įėjimo tašką."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "WordPress’s canonical surface is the public blog front page. The OIDC round-trip fires on ``/wp-login.php``, which the ``daggerhart-openid-connect-generic`` addon auto-redirects to Keycloak (``login_type: auto``, see ```meta/addons/daggerhart-openid-connect-generic.yml`` <./meta/addons/daggerhart-openid-connect-generic.yml>`__); the shared personas enter at the site root and never visit that path. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``. The journeys themselves are not dropped: ``test-admin-oidc-login.js`` drives the admin login, logout and landing assertion, and ``test-rbac-roles.js`` drives the Keycloak-group-to-WordPress-role mapping over the same entry point."
msgstr "WordPress kanoninis paviršius yra viešas dienoraščio pirmame puslapyje. OIDC žiedinės kelionės gaisrai ``/wp-login.php``, ``daggerhart-openid-connect-generic`` addon auto- nukreipti į Keycloak (``login_type: auto``, žr. ```meta/addons/daggerhart-openid-connect-generic.yml`` <./meta/addons/daggerhart-openid-connect-generic.yml>`__); the shared personas enter at the site root and never visit that path. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``. The journeys themselves are not dropped: ``test-admin-oidc-login.js`` drives the admin login, logout and landing assertion, and ``test-rbac-roles.js`` vairuoja Keycloak-grupė-ikiWordPress-vaidmuo kartografavimo per tą patį įėjimo tašką."

