msgid "[`mcp_authorization`](../../../../../../plugins/filter/mcp/authorization.py) raises for `auth: oidc`, because a rendered config cannot carry a caller's token, and `mcp_authorization_is_renderable` returns `false` so the static-config clients drop the server instead of presenting a wrong secret."
msgstr "[`mcp_authorization`](../../../../../../plugins/filter/mcp/authorization.py) kelia `auth: oidc`, nes lydytas config negali turėti skambinančiojo simbolį, ir `mcp_authorization_is_renderable` grąžinimai `false` todėl stic- config klientai lašas serverį, o ne pateikti klaidingą paslaptį."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`mcp_tool_server_connections`](../../../../../../plugins/filter/mcp/tool_server_connections.py) emits `auth_type: system_oauth` with an empty `key` for those servers, so Open WebUI resolves the caller's own token per request."
msgstr "[`mcp_tool_server_connections`](../../../../../../plugins/filter/mcp/tool_server_connections.py) emitai `auth_type: system_oauth` su tuščia `key` tiems serveriams, todėl Open WebUI išsprendžia skambinančiojo žymą kiekvienam prašymui."

