# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SeaweedFS <https://github.com/seaweedfs/seaweedfs>`__ is a fast distributed storage system for blobs, objects, and files. It exposes an S3-compatible API, so applications store and retrieve objects with standard S3 SDKs and CLIs."
msgstr "`SeaweedFS <https://github.com/seaweedfs/seaweedfs>`__ yra greitai paskirstytas saugojimo sistema blobs, objektai, ir failai. Jis parodo S3- suderinamas API, todėl programos saugoti ir gauti objektus su standartas S3 SDK ir CLL."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Semaphore UI <https://semaphoreui.com/>`__ is a modern web UI and API for running Ansible playbooks, Terraform/OpenTofu plans, and shell scripts on a schedule or on demand. This role deploys the official ```semaphoreui/semaphore`` <https://github.com/semaphoreui/semaphore>`__ container behind the Infinito.Nexus reverse proxy with central PostgreSQL, native Keycloak OIDC Single Sign-On, and optional LDAP login."
msgstr "`Semaphore UI <https://semaphoreui.com/>`__ yra modernus interneto UI ir API Antarktinių žaidimų knygoms, Terraform / OpenTofu planams ir apvalkalų scenarijams pagal tvarkaraštį arba pagal pareikalavimą. Šis vaidmuo vykdo pareigūnas ```semaphoreui/semaphore`` <https://github.com/semaphoreui/semaphore>`_ Dėklas už Infinito.Nexus Atvirkštinis proxy with central PostgreSQL, vietinis Keycloak OIDC Single Sig- On ir pasirenkamas LDAP prisijungimas."

