# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`git push`, `git fetch`, and `git clone` over SSH all require `ssh(1)` to read `~/.ssh/` (private keys, `known_hosts`, `config`). With `~/.ssh` in `denyRead`, `ssh` fails with `Host key verification failed` / `Could not read from remote repository`, which makes the `ask`-gated `Bash(git push*)` rule unreachable in practice."
